; error: 9:24: the map's keys hold what is in region 'inner', and 'm.keys' holds them, not copies, so it goes there too, as in 'm.keys at inner'; to keep them in 'outer', copy that, as in '(m.keys at inner).copy() at outer'
task main()
    region outer
    flex ks = new [text]() at outer
    when true
        region inner
        flex m = new [text: int]() at inner
        m["hello world, a long key".copy() at inner] = 1
        ks = m.keys at outer
    fi
    show(ks)
fi
